              "id": "ice-arrows:bring:1aqsd9c",
              "html": "Light source",
              "text": "Light source"
            }
          ],
          "recommended": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:1rkjq5y",
          "html": "Go through the south gate, and loot the chests in the tunnel for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ice_arrows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ice arrows</a>. After looting the arrows from a chest, the next set of arrows will spawn in another random chest and it is possible they will spawn in the same chest that you just searched. You will only need a couple of arrows. You can just go back and search the chests again, as the respawn/refresh rate is quite quick (no need to hop worlds).",
          "text": "Go through the south gate, and loot the chests in the tunnel for ice arrows. After looting the arrows from a chest, the next set of arrows will spawn in another random chest and it is possible they will spawn in the same chest that you just searched. You will only need a couple of arrows. You can just go back and search the chests again, as the respawn/refresh rate is quite quick (no need to hop worlds).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:fgftvt",
          "html": "With 20 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Limpwurt_roots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">limpwurt roots</a> and your bow, return to the main chamber with the bridge. Continue north past the trapdoor to the lever on the wall.",
          "text": "With 20 limpwurt roots and your bow, return to the main chamber with the bridge. Continue north past the trapdoor to the lever on the wall.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:h0t6g4",
          "html": "Right-click the lever and select <i>Search for traps</i>, then pull it.",
          "text": "Right-click the lever and select Search for traps, then pull it.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:2438xt",
          "html": "Run west and open the wooden door",
          "text": "Run west and open the wooden door",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:12vkbr5",
          "html": "Open the next door and kill the fire warrior that appears with ice arrows.",
          "text": "Open the next door and kill the fire warrior that appears with ice arrows.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:7wis49",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Winelda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Winelda</a>, and ask to be teleported across the lava. She will ask for 20 limpwurt roots.",
          "text": "Talk to Winelda, and ask to be teleported across the lava. She will ask for 20 limpwurt roots.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "Yes I do!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "ice-arrows:v7yvo6",
          "html": "(Optional) Take the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Shiny_key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shiny key</a> in the south-west part with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lesser_demon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lesser demons</a> to be able to access this area more easily from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/McGrubor%27s_Wood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">McGrubor&#39;s Wood</a>. If you have completed <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/One_Small_Favour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Small Favour</a> this key can be added to your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Steel_key_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">steel key ring</a>.",
          "text": "(Optional) Take the shiny key in the south-west part with the lesser demons to be able to access this area more easily from McGrubor's Wood. If you have completed One Small Favour this key can be added to your steel key ring.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
